#!/usr/bin/python3
"""mb-watch - twice-daily watchlist for top-level Mechabellum content.

Sources
  corpus   qbisi/mechcore-replay, new tournament match documents (Elo >= gate)
  youtube  tournament/pro searches, filtered by trusted channels, events, pros
  reddit   r/Mechabellum new posts mentioning pros/tournaments/replays
  fogmoe   FogMoe/Mechabellum-Replays releases (dormant until assets appear)

Only new items are stored; replays are deduplicated by BattleID and SHA-256.
Top-player gate defaults to Elo 1800 (roughly the in-game top 200), plus a
curated pro list. Everything is written to a watchlist and a per-run digest.

  mb-watch run [--notify] [--no-download]
  mb-watch list [--source S] [--all]
  mb-watch seen <id|--all>
  mb-watch sources
"""

